  "text": "Indian Society — Revision Notes High yield numbers + framing moves for GS 1 society answers. One liner anchors Diversity framed by unity in diversity with hierarchy/difference twin reading (Dumont vs Betéille). Untouchability abolished : Art.17; poles of enforcement: PCR 1955 → SC/ST PoA 1989 (+2015/2018 amendments). Quota architecture: SC 15 · ST 7.5 · OBC 27 · EWS 10 (103rd Amdt 2019) ; women's reservation 33% (106th Amdt 2023, post delimitation) . The 50% tableau: Indra Sawhney v UoI (1992) ceiling; Maratha judgment (2021) re affirmed ceiling, states barred from breaching post 102nd Amdt. Population numbers (NFHS 5 unless noted) TFR 2.0 (below replacement 2.1) : Bihar 3.4 highest; Kerala TN 1.8. Sex ratio: 943 (Census 2011); NFHS 5 1020 (methods caveat). Median age 28; working age bulge peak 2040. Migration: 450 mn internal migrators (2011 base); 2020 lockdown exodus. Urban anchors Ur",
