  "text": "Science & Tech — Prelims PYQs Q1. SpaDeX's primary purpose (Dec 2024/Jan 2025) was to demonstrate: (a) Solar sail propulsion (b) Autonomous rendezvous & docking (c) Cryogenic deep space staging (d) Reusable first stage recovery Model answer: (b). Key capability for Bharatiya Antariksh Station plans. Q2. Aditya L1 observes primarily at — (a) Earth's L2 (b) Sun Earth L1 halo orbit (c) Lunar orbit (d) GEO Model answer: (b). 1.5 million km sunward; PELKO coronagraph & UVIT etc. Q3. The CE 20 is a: (a) Semi cryogenic booster (b) Cryogenic upper stage engine of LVM3 (c) Solid strap on (d) Hypergolic thruster Model answer: (b). India's most powerful cryogenic engine; human rating variants drive Gaganyaan. Q4. MIRV technology was validated by India via: (a) Agni I \"Shourya\" (b) Agni V \"Mission Divyastra\" (c) Prithvi II (d) K 4 SLBM Model answer: (b). Tested 11 March 2024. Q5. [PYQ pattern] India",
